cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PapyGreek–LiGre, please cite it using the metadata below, and also cite the PapyGreek Treebanks it is derived from (see references)."
type: dataset
title: "PapyGreek–LiGre: the PapyGreek Treebanks as Linked Open Data, linked to the LiGre Lemma Bank"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
url: "https://w3id.org/ligre/data/corpora/PapyGreek/id/corpus"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ligre-lod/papygreek"
authors:
  - family-names: Lemay
    given-names: Paulien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2388-9233"
    affiliation: Ghent University
abstract: >-
  The PapyGreek Treebanks (558 documentary papyri in Postclassical Greek,
  ca. 300 BCE-700 CE, morphosyntactically annotated by the Digital Grammar of
  Greek Documentary Papyri project) as linked open data, modelled after the
  corpora of the LiLa Knowledge Base, with every token linked where possible
  to its lemma in the LiGre Lemma Bank for Ancient Greek.
keywords:
  - Ancient Greek
  - Postclassical Greek
  - documentary papyri
  - treebank
  - lemmatization
  - linked open data
  - LiGre
  - LiLa
